  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSB activities 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Work on (1) food security/poverty, (2) development of an online course on survey methodology and (3) work with international partners (World Bank, Paris21, WFP etc.) to strenghten the capacity of national statistics agencies in developing countries</narrative>
  </description>
